  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: a shelf key may work on several shelves. ShelfKeyInfo carries Grants, a list of ShelfKeyGrantInfo (the shelf's id and name and what the key may do there), in place of ShelfId and Permission, which are gone. SetShelfKeyGrantRequest gives a key a shelf or changes its permission there, and ShelfKeys.ValidatePermission refuses a value that is no ShelfKeyPermission. These are the types of a ByteShelf server whose keys hold grants (its migration v0014), which older clients cannot read. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/byte-shelf/blob/client-v3.0.0/ByteShelfCommon/README.md",
